---
description: DFlow trading API rules for Solana swap and prediction market integrations
globs: "**/*.{ts,tsx,js,jsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

- ALWAYS proxy DFlow Trade API calls through a backend for web apps — DFlow does not set CORS headers
- ALWAYS use atomic units for `amount` (1e9 for 1 SOL, 1e6 for 1 USDC)
- ALWAYS poll `/order-status` for async trades
- ALWAYS check Proof KYC before prediction market trades
- ALWAYS submit DFlow transactions via Helius Sender
- DFlow `/order` with `priorityLevel` already sets fees and Jito tips — do not duplicate compute budget ix
